# Deploy

When the user asks to **deploy**, choose the target from the **active workspace / cwd** — never guess across apps.

## Get Your Side Hustle (`side-hustle-hub`)

If the agent root or cwd is `side-hustle-hub` (or the user is working on GYSH):

```bash
cd C:\Users\evely\Documents\antigravity\eager-hypatia\side-hustle-hub
npm run deploy:pages
```

- **Cloudflare Pages** → `getyoursidehustle` project
- **Custom domain:** https://getyoursidehustle.com
- **Preview:** `https://*.getyoursidehustle.pages.dev`

Do **not** run eager-hypatia / mypartb `npm run deploy` for GYSH work.

After deploy, report the Pages preview URL + https://getyoursidehustle.com.

## Part B Optimizer (`eager-hypatia` / mypartb)

Only when the user is clearly working on mypartb / Part B Optimizer:

```bash
cd C:\Users\evely\Documents\antigravity\eager-hypatia
npm run deploy
```

This runs Pages (`mypartb`) **and** the Worker (`mypartb.com` / `mypartb.evelyn3.workers.dev`). Never Pages-only unless they explicitly say otherwise.

After deploy, report latest Pages preview + Worker URL.

## My Plan, Not My Mood (`my-plan-not-my-mood` / nonnegotiation.com)

When working in `my-plan-not-my-mood`:

```bash
cd C:\Users\evely\Documents\antigravity\eager-hypatia\my-plan-not-my-mood
bun run deploy
```

- **Live Production Domain**: https://nonnegotiation.com
- **Cloudflare Pages URL**: https://my-plan-not-my-mood.pages.dev
- **Local Dev Server**: http://localhost:3001 (`bun run dev`)
